    "title": "图三：重建失败的回退状态机",
    "caption": "原创源码控制流示意。分支覆盖登记、锁内复查、每对端冷却、旧准备清理、加载、重建与失败回退；循环只由后续失败触发。一秒为频率限制，不是后台定时器，也不是一秒内恢复承诺。健康旁路不经过重建。",
    "presentation": {
      "kind": "peer-reload",
      "panels": [
        {
          "title": "检查与限制",
          "tone": "control",
          "nodeIds": [
            "metadata-missing",
            "registration-check",
            "locked-recheck",
            "cooldown-check"
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "重建动作",
          "tone": "communication",
          "nodeIds": [
            "clear-prepared",
            "load-saved",
            "prepare-target"
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "本次结果",
          "tone": "danger",
          "nodeIds": [
            "skip-attempt",
            "ready-next",
            "remove-again"
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "健康旁路",
          "tone": "neutral",
          "nodeIds": [
            "healthy-bypass"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
